# Route: guide 34 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 51 to 53, 79
# quests, 5.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dun Morogh, Ironforge, Burning Steppes): The Grizzled Den -> Ironforge
# -> Shimmer Ridge -> The Grizzled Den -> Ironforge -> Misty Pine Refuge ->
# The Tundrid Hills -> Misty Pine Refuge -> Ironforge -> Misty Pine Refuge ->
# Ironforge -> Kharanos -> Amberstill Ranch -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Protecting the Herd (314; Vagash
# 11); Dragonkin Menace (4182; Black Dragonspawn 52-53, Black Drake 50-52,
# Black Wyrmkin 53-54).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): A Fine Mess (2904), The Sparklematic 5200! (2951), The
# Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962), The Only Cure is More Green Glow
# (2962), Hurley Blackbreath (4126), Old Ironforge Incursion (96393), Old
# Ironforge Incursion (96393), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the
# Deeps (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050),
# The Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the
# Necklace (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924),
# Essential Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal
# (2929), Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341),
